# vim: filetype=mbsync

###########################################

# Gmail <aviralkmdubey@gmail.com> Sync

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User aviralkmdubey@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass show mail/aviralkmdubey@gmail.com"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/.mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/.mail/gmail/INBOX
Subfolders Verbatim

Group all 

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Create Both
Expunge Both
Patterns *
SyncState *

###########################################
